{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-llm-quota-retry#card-zh","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-llm-quota-retry","commit":"fd130cc40e2f1ec36a0ff6a7f0822781568a0819","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Quota Long-Term Retry 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的模型额度恢复插件：它把 Cordis 行追加到 agent 请求错误处理流程，并提供会话设置和 composer 控件。额度失败时可按余额从 route pool 选择其他 provider/model 并立即重试；没有可用路由时，在当前 turn 内按配置间隔持续重试。用户可用 /quota-retry 开关此行为，用 /quota-pool 指定路由池，也可查看池状态。适合配置多个模型账户、希望请求在额度耗尽后继续处理的部署；余额查询可配置脚本，需宿主 subprocess 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:744","index.js:706","client.js:347","cordis.patch.yml:1"]}
{"unit_id":"windwhiterain__dsh-llm-quota-retry#card-en","repo":"windwhiterain/dsh-llm-quota-retry","commit":"fd130cc40e2f1ec36a0ff6a7f0822781568a0819","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Quota Long-Term Retry is a DeepSeek Harness Web plugin. It handles exhausted model quota by retrying on another configured route, or later when none has balance. Sessions control recovery with /quota-retry and choose route pools with /quota-pool. Balance scripts use the host subprocess service.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:744","index.js:706","client.js:347","cordis.patch.yml:1"]}
